{
  "version": 1,
  "courseId": 1362070,
  "sourceLanguage": "en",
  "targetLanguage": "zh-TW",
  "lectures": [
    {
      "id": "38348550",
      "title": "Adding CSS Modules",
      "sourceHash": "a624bfd282a7463b0cb315ba6409c13198326d0fbaff1d11ceaf3365f2ff6ca2",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.16,
          "end": 4.74,
          "en": "So let's now work on the styling,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 4.74,
          "end": 8.55,
          "en": "and, of course, in general, the app is already styled,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 8.55,
          "end": 11.853,
          "en": "and in my opinion, looks quite decent,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 12.78,
          "end": 15.96,
          "en": "so I'm not really talking about changing the styles.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 15.96,
          "end": 20.04,
          "en": "Also, because this, of course, isn't a CSS course,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 20.04,
          "end": 21.45,
          "en": "but instead, the goal is",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 21.45,
          "end": 24.183,
          "en": "to change how the styles are applied,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 25.26,
          "end": 27.66,
          "en": "and there actually is one place",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 27.66,
          "end": 29.31,
          "en": "where the styles should be changed,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 29.31,
          "end": 32.19,
          "en": "and that's here, for this fallback text.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 32.19,
          "end": 33.903,
          "en": "This doesn't look that great.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 35.31,
          "end": 37.53,
          "en": "Now, to change that style here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 37.53,
          "end": 42.24,
          "en": "I'll use an approach which you typically won't use too often",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 42.24,
          "end": 43.68,
          "en": "when building React apps,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 43.68,
          "end": 47.31,
          "en": "but which is absolutely fine for this simple use case.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 47.31,
          "end": 50.553,
          "en": "I'll add some inline styling to this paragraph.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 51.75,
          "end": 54.84,
          "en": "As you learned, you can do this by adding the style prop,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 54.84,
          "end": 58.2,
          "en": "and then you set this to an object.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 58.2,
          "end": 60.81,
          "en": "That's why you have double curly braces here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 60.81,
          "end": 64.71,
          "en": "not because it's some special styling syntax,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 64.71,
          "end": 65.64,
          "en": "but instead,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 65.64,
          "end": 69.93,
          "en": "because the value that's passed to the style prop here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 69.93,
          "end": 72.42,
          "en": "is a JavaScript object,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 72.42,
          "end": 75.45,
          "en": "which is created with a pair of curly braces,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 75.45,
          "end": 77.31,
          "en": "opening and closing.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 77.31,
          "end": 82.05,
          "en": "Here, we can then target all these different CSS properties,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 82.05,
          "end": 84.87,
          "en": "for example, textAlign,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 84.87,
          "end": 87.273,
          "en": "which I'll simply set to center here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 88.71000000000001,
          "end": 92.52000000000001,
          "en": "and with that, with that inline styling added here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 92.52000000000001,
          "end": 95.10300000000001,
          "en": "this fallback text is now centered,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 96.93,
          "end": 99.963,
          "en": "but that's the only new style I want to add.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 100.83,
          "end": 103.22999999999999,
          "en": "What I wanna do instead now is",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 103.22999999999999,
          "end": 105.9,
          "en": "I want to break up my existing styles,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 105.9,
          "end": 108.27000000000001,
          "en": "which I have in the index.css file,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 108.27000000000001,
          "end": 112.17,
          "en": "and use CSS modules to apply them",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 112.17,
          "end": 113.88300000000001,
          "en": "to the different components.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 115.25999999999999,
          "end": 116.093,
          "en": "Now, of course,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 116.093,
          "end": 119.72999999999999,
          "en": "that's absolutely not something you have to do,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 119.72999999999999,
          "end": 121.32,
          "en": "but something you can do",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 121.32,
          "end": 123.93,
          "en": "to make your CSS code more manageable",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 123.93,
          "end": 126.57300000000001,
          "en": "and something I will do here as an exercise,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 127.71,
          "end": 131.73,
          "en": "and therefore, I'll add a Header.module.css file",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 131.73,
          "end": 132.84,
          "en": "because, as you learned,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 132.84,
          "end": 136.56,
          "en": "that's how you can use this CSS modules feature",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 136.56,
          "end": 139.563,
          "en": "by adding CSS files with names like this,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 140.88,
          "end": 145.24,
          "en": "and I'll add our ResultsTable.module.css file",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 146.64,
          "end": 150.483,
          "en": "and a UserInput.module.css file,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 152.1,
          "end": 154.02,
          "en": "and now we can go back to index.css",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 154.02,
          "end": 157.07999999999998,
          "en": "and start with the code that belongs to the header.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 157.07999999999998,
          "end": 162.07999999999998,
          "en": "Here, I'll simply grab the header-related CSS rules,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 162.57,
          "end": 167.57,
          "en": "cut them, and add them to the Header.module.css file.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 168.267,
          "end": 172.11,
          "en": "Now, to make sure that these styles still get applied,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 172.11,
          "end": 174.9,
          "en": "we have to go to Header.js,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 174.9,
          "end": 177.66,
          "en": "and there, import those classes",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 177.66,
          "end": 181.023,
          "en": "from ./Header.module.css,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 182.52,
          "end": 183.353,
          "en": "and then, here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 183.353,
          "end": 187.5,
          "en": "instead of adding the className like this, as a string,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 187.5,
          "end": 191.793,
          "en": "we now have to add it as classes.header.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 194.67,
          "end": 197.67000000000002,
          "en": "With that, if you save this and reload,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 197.67000000000002,
          "end": 200.67000000000002,
          "en": "you should get the same look as before,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 200.67000000000002,
          "end": 203.79,
          "en": "but now, we put the header-related styles",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 203.79,
          "end": 205.833,
          "en": "into this CSS module file,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 206.76,
          "end": 207.593,
          "en": "and, of course,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 207.593,
          "end": 211.2,
          "en": "I'll do the same for the rest of this app as well.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 211.2,
          "end": 214.65,
          "en": "For that, I'll continue with the user-input-related styles",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 214.65,
          "end": 219.45,
          "en": "by grabbing this form rule here, the input-group rule,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 219.45,
          "end": 223.14,
          "en": "and all these other rules that are related to the form,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 223.14,
          "end": 226.773,
          "en": "including the button rules like this,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 228.51,
          "end": 229.98,
          "en": "cut them,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 229.98,
          "end": 234.54,
          "en": "and add them here to UserInput.module.css,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 234.54,
          "end": 238.413,
          "en": "and here, this should actually be .button:hover,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 240.06,
          "end": 242.79,
          "en": "and with that in UserInput.js,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 242.79,
          "end": 246.39,
          "en": "we, of course, also have to import classes",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 246.39,
          "end": 250.503,
          "en": "from ./UserInput.module.css,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 253.02,
          "end": 255.06,
          "en": "and now, here, on the form,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 255.06,
          "end": 258.933,
          "en": "we apply classes.form like this.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 260.31,
          "end": 261.99,
          "en": "Here, for the input-group,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 261.99,
          "end": 266.79,
          "en": "we apply classes, input-group like this.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 266.79,
          "end": 268.23,
          "en": "Since it contains a dash,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 268.23,
          "end": 270.57,
          "en": "we have to access this property like this.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 270.57,
          "end": 274.683,
          "en": "The dot notation won't work for a property name with a dash,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 276.54,
          "end": 279.96,
          "en": "and then, further down in this form,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 279.96,
          "end": 283.38,
          "en": "or actually, for all divs here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 84,
          "start": 283.38,
          "end": 285.03,
          "en": "that wrap multiple inputs,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 85,
          "start": 285.03,
          "end": 286.40999999999997,
          "en": "so also for this div,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 86,
          "start": 286.40999999999997,
          "end": 289.83299999999997,
          "en": "we have to use the same className, input-group,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 87,
          "start": 291.3,
          "end": 295.74,
          "en": "and then, further down in this JSX code here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 88,
          "start": 295.74,
          "end": 299.58299999999997,
          "en": "we have to use classes.actions,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 89,
          "start": 301.29,
          "end": 303.75,
          "en": "and then, for the button alt,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 90,
          "start": 303.75,
          "end": 306.687,
          "en": "we have to use classes.buttonAlt,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 91,
          "start": 307.83,
          "end": 311.793,
          "en": "and for this button, it's classes.button.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 92,
          "start": 313.83,
          "end": 316.2,
          "en": "With that, if we save this,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 93,
          "start": 316.2,
          "end": 318.18,
          "en": "again, it's the same look as before,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 94,
          "start": 318.18,
          "end": 320.523,
          "en": "but now, we're using CSS modules,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 95,
          "start": 321.63,
          "end": 323.67,
          "en": "and therefore, last but not least,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 96,
          "start": 323.67,
          "end": 328.23,
          "en": "I'll also cut all the result-related styles",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 97,
          "start": 328.23,
          "end": 330.66,
          "en": "and remove them from index.css",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 98,
          "start": 330.66,
          "end": 335.493,
          "en": "so that in there, only my basic page styles remain,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 99,
          "start": 336.81,
          "end": 340.02,
          "en": "and I'll go to ResultsTable.module.css",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 100,
          "start": 340.02,
          "end": 344.31,
          "en": "and paste in those result-related styles,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 101,
          "start": 344.31,
          "end": 345.61,
          "en": "and them, in ResultsTable,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 102,
          "start": 348.18,
          "end": 351.24,
          "en": "we can import, and we should import classes",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 103,
          "start": 351.24,
          "end": 355.593,
          "en": "from ./ResultsTable.module.css,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 104,
          "start": 356.55,
          "end": 359.90999999999997,
          "en": "and replace this string className here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 105,
          "start": 359.90999999999997,
          "end": 362.493,
          "en": "with classes.result.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 106,
          "start": 363.87,
          "end": 365.85,
          "en": "That's the only class in here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 107,
          "start": 365.85,
          "end": 369.84,
          "en": "and therefore, with that, if we save that and we reload,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 108,
          "start": 369.84,
          "end": 371.82,
          "en": "we get the same look as before,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 109,
          "start": 371.82,
          "end": 374.253,
          "en": "but now we're using CSS modules.",
          "zh": ""
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "errors": []
}